{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03224","headline":"自衡阳至韶州谒能禅师 · 宋之问","name":"自衡阳至韶州谒能禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谪居窜炎壑，孤帆淼不系。\n别家万里余，流目三春际。\n猿啼山馆晓，虹饮江皐霁。\n湘岸竹泉幽，衡峯石囷闭。\n岭嶂穷攀越，风涛极沿济。\n吾师在韶阳，欣此得躬诣。\n洗虑宾空寂，焚香结精誓。\n愿以有漏躯，聿薰无生慧。\n物用益冲旷，心源日闲细。\n伊我获此途，游道回晚计。\n宗师信舍法，摈落文史艺。\n坐禅罗浮中，寻异穷海裔。\n何辞御魑魅，自可乘炎疠。\n回首望旧乡，云林浩亏蔽。\n不作离别苦，归期多年岁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}